  "title": "Thịt Bò Xào Đậu (Vietnamese Stir-Fried Beef and Green Beans)",
  "description": "This is a Vietnamese beef and green bean stir-fry recipe with garlic, onion, and soy sauce. Serve over hot white rice for a quick and tasty meal.",
  "authors": [
    "Maryellen"
  ],
